The 会话 row pushes PdshRoute.Sessions; HostShell hands HostSessionsScreen into
PdshNavHost(sessions = ...). Tapping 新建会话 inside the routed page reaches the
host's own session handoff (PDSHSessions), so the page is the real list, not the
router's facts-only page.

